Use Go's existing unsupported paths for automatic toolchain replacement
and OS version telemetry on Kandelo. The guest SDK runs the installed
toolchain with GOTOOLCHAIN=local. The Go port lacks syscall.Exec and the
vendored Unix telemetry code does not implement Uname for Kandelo.

diff --git a/src/cmd/go/internal/toolchain/exec.go b/src/cmd/go/internal/toolchain/exec.go
